      "description": "Intermodal Tank Transport (ITT) is a Houston-headquartered, U.S.-based global provider of ISO-tank container transportation, logistics and depot services for bulk-liquid chemical and food-grade supply chains. Founded in Medellin in 1993, ITT arranges end-to-end transport across major modes, operates a tank fleet and provides maintenance, cleaning and inspection through a global office and depot network. Apollo Infrastructure Funds announced a structured equity investment in June 2023; later Apollo filings and portfolio materials support closed-active ownership, but the exact stake, broader legal closing date and specific current fund or vehicle are not publicly disclosed. ITT acquired Bulk Tainer Group in August 2025, and no Apollo exit was identified through August 8, 2026.",
